          <div class="aalto-hub-desc__body">
            <h2 id="hub-desc-title-id-872354672" class="aalto-hub-desc__header">
  Grants and awards</h2>
            
                    <div class="aalto-user-generated-content"><p>This bulletin board is for notifications of grants available to Aalto students and staff – i.e. individual scholarships, travel grants and similar bursaries and awards.</p>
<p>Aalto University is not responsible for the content of the grant board. Read the notifications carefully and check the information with the advertiser. Note that some funding bodies award grants more than once a year (continuous application process). You can find other scholarship portals here.</p></div>
            
